:"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1999-04-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6IPSetmRhBJ6wHSzL4urx6y7XtN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6IPSetmRhBJ6wHSzL4urx6y7XtN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34159/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"783824","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Peccati di gola","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yui and IR suspect foul play when Chef Kirch, a family friend who can never get his recipes quite right. In the beginning if he mentions he has a new dish everyone wants to run for cover! Yui unable to turn down a friend tries it. Its actually good! He found a recipe on Comnet and a special seasoning has him with more customers than he can handle. Soon it gets out of hand and he has to face customers who've turned into ravenous zombies.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1999-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jKSsSyUjILuLHdeZMLCqDY51GKx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jKSsSyUjILuLHdeZMLCqDY51GKx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34159/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"783825","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Il sito della fortuna in amore","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A school-craze for fortune-telling develops into a destructive obsession. Who knew love advice could be so dangerous?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1999-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tRj9zbwsFwXvEFUVv1ogNYwXk5p.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tRj9zbwsFwXvEFUVv1ogNYwXk5p.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34159/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"783827","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"La voce della foresta 